# analogioc macro port list -- THE contract (analog/analogioc/docs/INTERFACE.md).
# One port bit per line, in exact .subckt order: <name> <direction> <kind> <domain>.
# Vectors are bit-blasted LSB first as name[i]; the .subckt spells the same bit name<i>.
# direction is seen from the macro. kind: digital | analog | supply.
# domain: the supply rail the pin is referenced to (digital pins swing 0..vdd).
# Lines starting with # are comments.
